            </picture>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-center text-sm text-ink-mute mt-6">Manage your club from your laptop or your phone at poolside.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- The Problem -->
    <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl text-[#0F2D2D] mb-8">The admin problem killing swim clubs</h2>
      <div class="space-y-6 text-ink-soft">
        <p>
          Running a swimming club in the UK is a volunteer effort. Chairs, treasurers, membership secretaries, and safeguarding officers give up their evenings and weekends to keep things running. But outdated tools make the job harder than it needs to be:
        </p>
        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mt-8">
          <div class="relative bg-surface-raised rounded-2xl border border-[#39393A]/10 shadow-[0_1px_3px_rgba(57,57,58,0.08)] p-6">
            <XCircle class="w-8 h-8 text-[#B91C1C]/70 mb-4" />
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#0F2D2D] mb-3">Spreadsheet chaos</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-ink-mute">Membership records in Excel, fee tracking in Google Sheets, attendance on paper. Nothing connects, nothing syncs, and nobody has the latest version.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="relative bg-surface-raised rounded-2xl border border-[#39393A]/10 shadow-[0_1px_3px_rgba(57,57,58,0.08)] p-6">
            <Clock class="w-8 h-8 text-[#B91C1C]/70 mb-4" />
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#0F2D2D] mb-3">Admin overload</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-ink-mute">Chasing late payments, reconciling bank statements, printing registers, emailing parents one at a time. Your volunteers spend more time on admin than on the club.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="relative bg-surface-raised rounded-2xl border border-[#39393A]/10 shadow-[0_1px_3px_rgba(57,57,58,0.08)] p-6">
            <Users class="w-8 h-8 text-[#B91C1C]/70 mb-4" />
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#0F2D2D] mb-3">Volunteer burnout</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-ink-mute">Committee members burn out within a year or two. Knowledge walks out the door with them, and the next person starts from scratch.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p>
          Swim club management software solves these problems by bringing everything into one platform that any committee member can use.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- The Solution -->
    <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl text-[#0F2D2D] mb-8">What Swimly does for your club</h2>
      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-surface-raised border border-[#39393A]/10 shadow-[0_1px_3px_rgba(57,57,58,0.08)] hover:shadow-[0_12px_32px_-12px_rgba(15,45,45,0.2)] transition-all">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-[#85FFC7]/20 border border-[#1F7A52]/15 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <Users class="w-5 h-5 text-mint-ink" />
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#0F2D2D] mb-3">Membership management</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-ink-mute leading-relaxed">
            Centralised member database with swimmer profiles, family accounts, emergency contacts, and medical information. Parents update their own details through a self-service portal.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-surface-raised border border-[#39393A]/10 shadow-[0_1px_3px_rgba(57,57,58,0.08)] hover:shadow-[0_12px_32px_-12px_rgba(15,45,45,0.2)] transition-all">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-[#85FFC7]/20 border border-[#1F7A52]/15 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <CreditCard class="w-5 h-5 text-mint-ink" />
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#0F2D2D] mb-3">Automated billing</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-ink-mute leading-relaxed">
            Collect fees automatically via Direct Debit through GoCardless. Different fee structures per squad, sibling discounts, and automatic invoice generation. Failed payments retried automatically.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-surface-raised border border-[#39393A]/10 shadow-[0_1px_3px_rgba(57,57,58,0.08)] hover:shadow-[0_12px_32px_-12px_rgba(15,45,45,0.2)] transition-all">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-[#85FFC7]/20 border border-[#1F7A52]/15 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <ClipboardCheck class="w-5 h-5 text-mint-ink" />
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#0F2D2D] mb-3">Attendance tracking</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-ink-mute leading-relaxed">
            Digital registers on coaches' phones, right at poolside. No more paper registers that get wet, lost, or forgotten. Session history stored automatically for safeguarding and reporting.
