        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-surface-raised border border-[#39393A]/10 shadow-[0_1px_3px_rgba(57,57,58,0.08)] hover:shadow-[0_12px_32px_-12px_rgba(15,45,45,0.2)] transition-all">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-[#85FFC7]/20 border border-[#1F7A52]/15 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <Shield class="w-5 h-5 text-mint-ink" />
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#0F2D2D] mb-3">Wavepower compliance</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-ink-mute leading-relaxed">
            Track DBS certificates, coaching qualifications, and safeguarding training with automatic renewal reminders. Compliance dashboard for Swim England inspections and SwimMark accreditation.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-surface-raised border border-[#39393A]/10 shadow-[0_1px_3px_rgba(57,57,58,0.08)] hover:shadow-[0_12px_32px_-12px_rgba(15,45,45,0.2)] transition-all">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-[#85FFC7]/20 border border-[#1F7A52]/15 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <MessageSquare class="w-5 h-5 text-mint-ink" />
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#0F2D2D] mb-3">Communication</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-ink-mute leading-relaxed">
            Send targeted announcements to specific squads or the entire club. Automatic session cancellation alerts, payment reminders, and renewal notifications.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-surface-raised border border-[#39393A]/10 shadow-[0_1px_3px_rgba(57,57,58,0.08)] hover:shadow-[0_12px_32px_-12px_rgba(15,45,45,0.2)] transition-all">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-[#85FFC7]/20 border border-[#1F7A52]/15 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <Smartphone class="w-5 h-5 text-mint-ink" />
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#0F2D2D] mb-3">Works poolside</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-ink-mute leading-relaxed">
            Built mobile-first for 6am poolside sessions. Coaches take attendance on phones, parents check schedules on the go, and committees manage from anywhere.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Comparison Table -->
    <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl text-[#0F2D2D] mb-8">How Swimly compares</h2>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto">
